# Photographs as they came off the phone. Several megabytes each, and still
# carrying their EXIF, which includes where the picture was taken — this repo
# is public and everything in it is served, so the originals stay local.
# tools/images.py writes the published versions into assets/, resized and with
# the metadata stripped.
content/*/

# Python leaves these behind when one tool imports another.
__pycache__/
